        <mxCell id="ribbon_22" value="Phase 5: Zero-LLM SQLite 证据索引直出 (Vol 05) · 分卷精细裁剪 Context 组装 #4 · 5 路并行旗舰长文合成 (Vol 00–04)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#065F46;strokeColor=#065F46;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=12;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
