        <mxCell id="ribbon_24" value="Phase 6 &amp; 7: 确定性正则审计 · 异构 Critic 反思闭环 · Corrective RAG / 定向重修路由 · Stage-Gate 100分裁判 · 终稿编译落盘" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#9F1239;strokeColor=#9F1239;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=12;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
